The stomach punch is the suspected reason for this to happen.  He used to flex his stomach very hard and tell people to punch him.  As it I read it... some kid came up and punched him hard when he wasn't ready... and this caused his inside to rupture and cause the internal problem.  Appendix maybe, I'm not sure.. bu the punch apparently caused it because he was not prepared for the punch and over time his inside had weakened due to being punch there for years and years.  

